      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p06.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "ಹಳದಿ, ಕೆಂಪು, ಗುಲಾಬಿ..."
